        <procedure title="Adds a Firm Sanction Impact Score" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Firm Sanction Impact Score</p>
            <p>Adds a new firm sanction impact score with regulation group, risk points, and color</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Firm Sanction Evaluation Grades. 2. Click "Add". 3. Enter Name. 4. Select Regulation Group. 5. Enter Risk Point. 6. Select Color. 7. Click Save.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Firm sanction impact score is added successfully with a confirmation message.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
